{
  "platform": "qoder",
  "version": "global",
  "name": "Qoder 国际版 · 每日 Credits",
  "contract_version": "2026-11-18.real-6",
  "status": "active",
  "template": false,
  "note": "真实接口，网关 openapi.qoder.sh。国际版 claim 需要完整设备风控头 + JSON body；判定与国内版一致。PAT 通过 QODER_GLOBAL_PAT 环境变量提供。活动资格：活动 2026-09-18 上线；自 2026-11-19 10:00 起每日 100 通用 Credits 仅面向 Pro 试用期及 Lite/Pro/Pro+/Ultra 个人付费订阅用户，免费体验版不再开放领取；奖励 30 天有效、未到期可跨天保留，调整前已领取的不受影响；资格不符时无 CLAIM_BENEFIT 属平台规则，非契约漂移。",
  "upstream_references": [
    "L0NE-6/Qoder-Daily"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "timeout": 25,
    "headers": {
      "Accept": "application/json",
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
      "User-Agent": "Qoder/claim",
      "Cosy-ClientType": "10",
      "Cosy-Version": "${cred.client_version}",
      "Cosy-MachineOS": "${cred.machine_os}",
      "Cosy-MachineId": "${cred.machine_id}",
      "Cosy-MachineHostname": "${cred.machine_hostname}",
      "Cosy-MachineToken": "${cred.machine_token}",
      "Cosy-MachineCode": "${cred.machine_code}",
      "Cosy-MachineType": "${cred.machine_type}"
    }
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "header": "Authorization",
    "prefix": "Bearer ",
    "headers": {
      "Authorization": "Bearer ${token}"
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "campaigns",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://openapi.qoder.sh/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns",
      "headers": {},
      "capture": [
        {
          "name": "campaign_id",
          "path": "$.campaigns",
          "select": {
            "actionType": "CLAIM_BENEFIT",
            "benefit.kind": "CREDITS",
            "benefit.amount": 100,
            "claimStatus": "CLAIMABLE"
          },
          "field": "$.campaignId",
          "simulate": "sim-global-100"
        }
      ],
      "expected_shape": {
        "type": "object",
        "required_paths": [],
        "field_types": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "checkin",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://openapi.qoder.sh/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns/${var.campaign_id}/claim",
      "headers": {},
      "body": {},
      "when": {
        "var.campaign_id": {
          "exists": true,
          "truthy": true
        }
      },
      "expected_shape": {
        "type": "object",
        "required_paths": [],
        "field_types": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "response": {
    "json_paths": {
      "success": [
        "$.status"
      ],
      "already": [
        "$.status"
      ],
      "failed": [
        "$.failureCode"
      ],
      "credits": [
        "$.benefit.amount",
        "$.data.benefit.amount"
      ],
      "message": [
        "$.message",
        "$.failureCode"
      ]
    },
    "values": {
      "success": [
        "CLAIMED",
        "GRANTED",
        "SUCCESS"
      ],
      "already": [
        "BLOCKED",
        "ALREADY_CLAIMED"
      ],
      "failed": [
        "INVALID_DEVICE",
        "INTERNAL_ERROR",
        401,
        403,
        409
      ]
    },
    "expected_shape": {
      "type": "object",
      "required_paths": [],
      "field_types": {}
    },
    "verdicts": [
      {
        "status": "failed",
        "fatal": true,
        "steps": [
          "campaigns"
        ],
        "message": "Qoder 凭据已失效（查询活动时鉴权被拒），请重新登录客户端或重新生成凭据",
        "match": {
          "$.code": {
            "in": [
              "TOKEN_EXPIRE",
              "TOKEN_INVALID",
              "UNAUTHORIZED",
              "INVALID_TOKEN",
              "FORBIDDEN"
            ]
          }
        },
        "auth": true
      },
      {
        "status": "failed",
        "fatal": true,
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "Qoder 凭据已失效（领取积分时鉴权被拒），请重新登录客户端或重新生成凭据",
        "match": {
          "$.code": {
            "in": [
              "TOKEN_EXPIRE",
              "TOKEN_INVALID",
              "UNAUTHORIZED",
              "INVALID_TOKEN",
              "FORBIDDEN"
            ]
          }
        },
        "auth": true
      },
      {
        "status": "skipped",
        "steps": [
          "campaigns"
        ],
        "message": "当前无可领取的每日 Credits 活动（未开窗或今日已领完）",
        "match": {
          "var.campaign_id": {
            "exists": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "already",
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "同一设备身份下今日已领取",
        "match": {
          "$.status": {
            "equals": [
              "BLOCKED"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "already",
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "活动已重复领取",
        "match": {
          "$.failureCode": {
            "equals": [
              "SAME_PERSON_ALREADY_CLAIMED"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "success",
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "Qoder 国际版 Credits 领取成功",
        "credits_path": "$.benefit.amount",
        "match": {
          "$.status": {
            "equals": [
              "CLAIMED",
              "GRANTED",
              "SUCCESS"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "failed",
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "领取失败（设备风控或上游错误）",
        "match": {
          "$.failureCode": {
            "exists": true
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "change_signals": [
    "活动列表被设备风控降级：缺 Cosy-MachineToken/Code/Type 时只返回订阅推广，每日 CLAIM_BENEFIT 活动不会出现在 campaigns 里（看起来像没有活动）",
    "鉴权失效（HTTP 401 / code=TOKEN_EXPIRE）必须先于「无可领活动」判定，否则会被当成正常跳过",
    "claim 响应为扁平结构：benefit.amount 在顶层（不在 data 下）",
    "缺少 Cosy-ClientType: 10 时服务端返回空 campaigns（不是没有活动）",
    "UMID 设备头要求变化",
    "claim body 结构变化",
    "openapi.qoder.sh 网关变化"
  ]
}
